Author: Yuting Wang [aut, cre], Xiaotao Shen [aut, cph]
Maintainer: Yuting Wang <ytwangzero@outlook.com>
Description: 
    featuremap provides a network-based framework for identifying and 
    interpreting functional metabolic modules from metabolomics data. 
    The package integrates feature-level statistical scoring, 
    prize-collecting Steiner forest (PCSF) network optimization, 
    community detection, permutation-based module significance testing, 
    and optional literature- and large language model (LLM)-assisted 
    functional annotation. It is designed to support reproducible 
    systems-level interpretation of metabolomics studies.
